LangString MVRequiresArm64 1029 "Tento instalační program vyžaduje Windows na ARM64."
LangString MVRequiresArm64 1043 "Dit installatieprogramma vereist Windows op ARM64."
LangString MVRequiresArm64 1036 "Ce programme d’installation nécessite Windows sur ARM64."
LangString MVRequiresArm64 1031 "Dieses Installationsprogramm erfordert Windows auf ARM64."
LangString MVRequiresArm64 1081 "इस इंस्टॉलर को ARM64 पर Windows की आवश्यकता है।"
LangString MVRequiresArm64 1057 "Penginstal ini memerlukan Windows di ARM64."
LangString MVRequiresArm64 1040 "Questo programma di installazione richiede Windows su ARM64."
