LangString MVRemoveFailed 1033 "The existing Markdown Vision installation could not be removed. Setup will stop without installing the native edition."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1025 "تعذر إزالة تثبيت Markdown Vision الحالي. سيتوقف برنامج التثبيت دون تثبيت Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 2052 "无法移除现有的 Markdown Vision 安装。安装程序将停止，不会安装 Markdown Vision Native。"
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1028 "無法移除現有的 Markdown Vision 安裝。安裝程式將停止，不會安裝 Markdown Vision Native。"
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1029 "Stávající instalaci Markdown Vision se nepodařilo odebrat. Instalace se ukončí bez instalace Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1043 "De bestaande installatie van Markdown Vision kon niet worden verwijderd. Het installatieprogramma stopt zonder Markdown Vision Native te installeren."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1036 "Impossible de supprimer l’installation existante de Markdown Vision. Le programme d’installation va s’arrêter sans installer Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1031 "Die vorhandene Installation von Markdown Vision konnte nicht entfernt werden. Das Installationsprogramm wird beendet, ohne Markdown Vision Native zu installieren."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1081 "Markdown Vision का मौजूदा इंस्टॉलेशन हटाया नहीं जा सका। सेटअप Markdown Vision Native को इंस्टॉल किए बिना बंद हो जाएगा।"
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1057 "Pemasangan Markdown Vision yang ada tidak dapat dihapus. Pemasang akan berhenti tanpa memasang Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1040 "Non è stato possibile rimuovere l’installazione esistente di Markdown Vision. Il programma di installazione si interromperà senza installare Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1041 "既存の Markdown Vision を削除できませんでした。Markdown Vision Native をインストールせずにセットアップを終了します。"
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1042 "기존 Markdown Vision 설치를 제거하지 못했습니다. 설치 프로그램이 Markdown Vision Native를 설치하지 않고 종료됩니다."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1045 "Nie udało się usunąć istniejącej instalacji Markdown Vision. Instalator zakończy działanie bez instalowania Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1046 "Não foi possível remover a instalação existente do Markdown Vision. O instalador será encerrado sem instalar o Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1049 "Не удалось удалить существующую версию Markdown Vision. Программа установки завершит работу без установки Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 3082 "No se ha podido eliminar la instalación existente de Markdown Vision. El instalador se cerrará sin instalar Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1053 "Det gick inte att ta bort den befintliga installationen av Markdown Vision. Installationsprogrammet avslutas utan att installera Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1054 "ไม่สามารถนำ Markdown Vision ที่ติดตั้งอยู่ออกได้ โปรแกรมติดตั้งจะหยุดโดยไม่ติดตั้ง Markdown Vision Native"
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1055 "Mevcut Markdown Vision kurulumu kaldırılamadı. Kurulum, Markdown Vision Native kurulmadan durdurulacak."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1058 "Не вдалося видалити наявну версію Markdown Vision. Програма встановлення завершить роботу без установлення Markdown Vision Native."
LangString MVRemoveFailed 1066 "Không thể gỡ bản Markdown Vision hiện có. Trình cài đặt sẽ dừng và không cài đặt Markdown Vision Native."

LangString MVRegisterViewer 1033 "You can choose Markdown Vision as the default app for Markdown files in Windows Settings."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1025 "يمكنك اختيار Markdown Vision تطبيقًا افتراضيًا لملفات Markdown في إعدادات Windows."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 2052 "您可以在 Windows 设置中选择 Markdown Vision 作为 Markdown 文件的默认应用。"
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1028 "您可以在 Windows 設定中選擇 Markdown Vision 作為 Markdown 檔案的預設應用程式。"
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1029 "Ve Windows můžete v Nastavení zvolit Markdown Vision jako výchozí aplikaci pro soubory Markdown."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1043 "U kunt Markdown Vision in Windows-instellingen kiezen als standaardapp voor Markdown-bestanden."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1036 "Dans les paramètres Windows, vous pouvez choisir Markdown Vision comme application par défaut pour les fichiers Markdown."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1031 "Sie können Markdown Vision in den Windows-Einstellungen als Standard-App für Markdown-Dateien auswählen."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1081 "आप Windows सेटिंग में Markdown फ़ाइलों के लिए Markdown Vision को डिफ़ॉल्ट ऐप चुन सकते हैं।"
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1057 "Anda dapat memilih Markdown Vision sebagai aplikasi bawaan untuk berkas Markdown di Pengaturan Windows."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1040 "Nelle impostazioni di Windows puoi scegliere Markdown Vision come app predefinita per i file Markdown."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1041 "Windows の設定で Markdown Vision を Markdown ファイルの既定のアプリに選択できます。"
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1042 "Windows 설정에서 Markdown Vision을 Markdown 파일의 기본 앱으로 선택할 수 있습니다."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1045 "W ustawieniach systemu Windows można wybrać Markdown Vision jako domyślną aplikację do plików Markdown."
LangString MVRegisterViewer 1046 "Nas configurações do Windows, você pode escolher o Markdown Vision como aplicativo padrão para arquivos Markdown."
